
# 🌾 Agrokratis

### Voice-Based Agricultural Seed Distribution System

*Empowering rural Indian farmers with voice-driven access to government-subsidized seeds*

[![Node.js](https://img.shields.io/badge/Node.js-16%2B-339933?style=for-the-badge&logo=nodedotjs&logoColor=white)](https://nodejs.org/)
