## 📖 Overview

**Agrokratis** addresses the critical gap in agricultural service delivery by providing a **voice-based IVR interface** that enables farmers to order government-subsidized seeds using any basic mobile phone — no internet, no smartphone, no literacy required.

Farmers interact in their **native language**, go through a simple automated workflow, and complete an order in under 60 seconds. Government administrators monitor everything through a live **React web dashboard**.

### 🎯 Problem Solved

| Challenge | Solution |
|-----------|----------|
| Farmers in remote areas can't reach offices | Voice interface over any phone |
| Limited literacy / no smartphone | DTMF keypad + speech input |
| Language barrier | 5 regional languages supported |
| Manual eligibility checks | Automated 30-day restriction enforcement |
| Inventory mismanagement | Real-time stock updates across all channels |

---

## ✨ Features

### 📞 Farmer-Facing (Voice IVR)
- 🗣️ **Multi-language Support** — Telugu, Hindi, Tamil, Malayalam, Kannada
- ⌨️ **Dual Input** — DTMF keypad and speech recognition
- 🔐 **Aadhaar Authentication** — Secure 12-digit identity verification
- 📦 **Real-time Inventory** — Prevents out-of-stock orders automatically
- ⏱️ **30-Day Eligibility Enforcement** — Per ration card restriction
- ⚡ **Fast Workflow** — Complete orders in ~60 seconds

### 🖥️ Administrator (Web Dashboard)
- 📊 **Live Dashboard** — Auto-refreshes every 10 seconds
- 🌱 **Seed Management** — Full CRUD for seed inventory
- 📋 **Order Tracking** — All transactions with filtering
- 🟢 **Ration Card Monitor** — Color-coded eligibility status
- 🔄 **Real-time Sync** — Voice and web always in sync

---

## 🛠️ Technology Stack

### Backend
| Technology | Purpose |
|------------|---------|
| Node.js 16+ | Runtime environment |
| Express 4.x | Web framework |
| Firebase Firestore | NoSQL database |
| Twilio Voice API | IVR / telephony |
| Firebase Admin SDK | Authentication & DB access |

### Frontend
| Technology | Purpose |
|------------|---------|
| React 18 | UI library |
| Vite | Build tool & dev server |
| Axios | HTTP client |
| React Hooks | State management |

