## 🏗️ System Architecture

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐
│            Presentation Layer            │
│       Twilio Voice  │  React Dashboard   │
└─────────────────────┬───────────────────┘
                      │
┌─────────────────────▼───────────────────┐
│            Application Layer             │
│    Node.js / Express  │  Business Logic  │
│         Controllers  │  Session Mgmt     │
└─────────────────────┬───────────────────┘
                      │
┌─────────────────────▼───────────────────┐
│               Data Layer                 │
│         Firebase  │  Firestore DB        │
└─────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

### 🗄️ Firestore Collections

**`seeds`** — Seed inventory
```
id | name | nameLocal (te/hi/ta/ml/kn) | costPerKg | stock
```

**`orders`** — Transaction history
```
id | date | seedName | amount | rationCard | aadhaar | language
```

**`rationcards`** — Eligibility tracking
```
number | used (boolean) | lastUsed (timestamp)
```

---

## ⚙️ Prerequisites

- **Node.js** v16 or higher
- **npm** (bundled with Node.js)
- **Git**
- A modern web browser
- **Firebase** account (free tier works)
- **Twilio** account with a voice-capable phone number
- **ngrok** account (for local development tunneling)

---

## 🚀 Installation

### 1. Clone the Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/SpringMan-Sonic/agrokratis.git
cd agrokratis
```

### 2. Backend Setup

```bash
cd backend
npm install
```

### 3. Frontend Setup

```bash
cd ../frontend
npm install
```

### 4. Firebase Setup

1. Create a project at [console.firebase.google.com](https://console.firebase.google.com)
2. Enable **Firestore Database**
3. Generate a service account key:
   > Project Settings → Service Accounts → Generate New Private Key
4. Save the JSON file as `backend/serviceAccountKey.json`

### 5. Seed the Firestore Collections

Create three collections in Firestore Console:

<details>
<summary><b>seeds</b> — Example document</summary>

```
Document ID: seed_001
{
  name: "Rice",
  nameLocal: {
    te: "Vadlu",
    hi: "Chawal",
    ta: "Arisi",
    ml: "Ari",
    kn: "Akki"
  },
  costPerKg: 50,
  stock: 5000
}
```
</details>

<details>
<summary><b>rationcards</b> — Example documents (RC0001 to RC0010)</summary>

```
Document ID: RC0001
{
  used: false,
  lastUsed: null
}
```
</details>

> The **`orders`** collection auto-populates when farmers place orders.

---

## 🔧 Configuration

### Backend — `backend/.env`

```env
PORT=3001
TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID=your_twilio_account_sid
TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN=your_twilio_auth_token
TWILIO_PHONE_NUMBER=your_twilio_phone_number
```

### Frontend — `frontend/.env`

```env
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:3001/api
```

### Twilio Webhook Configuration

1. Log in to the [Twilio Console](https://console.twilio.com)
2. Go to your purchased phone number settings
3. Set the following webhooks:

| Event | URL | Method |
|-------|-----|--------|
| Voice | `https://<your-ngrok-url>/api/voice` | HTTP POST |
| Status Callback | `https://<your-ngrok-url>/api/voice/hangup` | HTTP POST |

---

## ▶️ Usage

### Development Mode

```bash
# Terminal 1 — Backend
cd backend && npm run dev
# Runs on http://localhost:3001

# Terminal 2 — Frontend
cd frontend && npm run dev
# Runs on http://localhost:5173

# Terminal 3 — ngrok tunnel
ngrok http 3001
# Copy HTTPS URL → update Twilio webhooks
```

### 📞 Farmer Workflow (Voice)

```
Call Twilio number
  └─ Select language     (Press 1–5)
       └─ Enter ration card number  (4 digits)
            └─ Select seed type     (Press 1–3)
                 └─ Enter quantity  (in grams)
                      └─ Enter Aadhaar  (12 digits)
                           └─ ✅ Order confirmed
```

### 🖥️ Admin Dashboard

Open `http://localhost:5173` in your browser and navigate between:
- **Seed Inventory** — Add, edit, delete seeds
- **Orders** — Browse all completed transactions
- **Ration Cards** — Monitor eligibility with color-coded status

---

## 📡 API Documentation

**Base URL:** `http://localhost:3001/api`

### Seeds

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| `GET` | `/seeds` | Get all seeds |
| `POST` | `/seeds` | Create a seed `{ name, nameLocal, costPerKg, stock }` |
| `PUT` | `/seeds/:id` | Update a seed |
| `DELETE` | `/seeds/:id` | Delete a seed |

### Orders

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| `GET` | `/orders` | Get all orders (sorted by date DESC) |
| `POST` | `/orders` | Create an order (internal use) |

### Ration Cards

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| `GET` | `/rationcards` | Get all cards with computed status |
| `GET` | `/rationcards/:number` | Check single card: `{ canOrder, daysRemaining }` |

### Voice Webhooks (Twilio)

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| `POST` | `/api/voice` | Handle incoming call → TwiML |
| `POST` | `/api/voice/gather` | Process DTMF/speech input → TwiML |
| `POST` | `/api/voice/hangup` | Clean up session on call end |

