## 📊 Performance Benchmarks

> Based on testing with **45 simulated calls**

| Metric | Result |
|--------|--------|
| Voice Interaction Success Rate | **88%** |
| DTMF Input Accuracy | **100%** |
| Speech Recognition Accuracy | 70–92% |
| Average Order Completion Time | **~66 seconds** |
| DB Read Operations | 58–95ms avg |
| DB Write Operations | 105–135ms avg |
| Full Transaction (end-to-end) | **~520ms** |
| Dashboard Load Time | **1.85 seconds** |
| Language Comprehension | 85–92% across all languages |

---

## 🔍 Troubleshooting

<details>
<summary><b>404 Not Found on /api/voice</b></summary>

Check that `index.routes.js` has:
```js
router.use('/api/voice', voiceRoutes)
```
</details>

<details>
<summary><b>500 Internal Server Error on voice calls</b></summary>

Verify `serviceAccountKey.json` is valid and Firestore is correctly initialized in `firebase.config.js`.
</details>

<details>
<summary><b>Frontend can't connect to backend (CORS error)</b></summary>

Update `app.js` CORS configuration to include your frontend URL:
```js
cors({ origin: 'http://localhost:5173' })
```
</details>

<details>
<summary><b>Ration card stays "Used" permanently</b></summary>

Check the 30-day date calculation logic in `rationCard.model.js`.
</details>

<details>
<summary><b>Dashboard not auto-updating</b></summary>

Verify the 10-second polling interval in `useRationCards.js` and `useOrders.js`.
</details>

